rview":"An MMO gamer awakens as the Black-Winged Tyrant, Lufas Maphaahl, rising from her sealed fate—only to find this is very real. Her defeat 200 years ago unleashed monsters of death, and the legend is one of terror. Now, trapped in the body of history's most feared conqueror, he must survive a world that wants her dead…and uncover why he's here."},{"language":"ja-JP","overview":"ミズガルズ暦2800年、\"黒翼の覇王\"と人々から恐れられた「ルファス・マファール」は、「七英雄」と呼ばれる勇者たちとの最終決戦による激闘の末、その覇道に終焉を迎える。覇王の封印によって安寧の時代が訪れるかに思われたが･･･、力の均衡が崩れた事で、世界は魔神族の脅威にさらされるのであった。それから200年後──、魔神族に対抗すべく人類は新たな勇者の召喚を試みる。しかしそこに現れたのは、長き封印から目覚めた覇王ルファスの姿だった！"}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cklffgw8EqqWLiobCuXI1jBa2fU.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/cklffgw8EqqWLiobCuXI1jBa2fU.png","language":"en","width":630,"height":304},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fJHphMeyfNJfpkLCnf6fdyjWpXh.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fJHphMeyfNJfpkLCnf6fdyjWpXh.png","language":"en","width":794,"height":178},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dlLrd2N8QRLCrqAR0G8K2LcIME4.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dlLrd2N8QRLCrqAR0G8K2LcIME4.png","language":"ja","width":697,"height":409}],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xh9lu8gDgzwMBiByTRtTsclluZf.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xh9lu8gDgzwMBiByTRtTsclluZf.jpg","language":"en","width":718,"height":1024},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sDb5USp0nknvs3mHmyurgH8y3z6.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/sDb5USp0nknvs3mHmyurgH8y3z6.jpg","language":"en","width":1200,"height":1800},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9dhoMwDpkJm5dsSIiHMPl7or76t.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9dhoMwDpkJm5dsSIiHMPl7or76t.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vrI5vaabJ928ka3iced